        "image_position": "right",
        "mobile_image_position": "top",
        "title": "Passive Lighting",
        "detection": "<p>Our wheel chair accessible Meeting Booths have non-directional main *4000k (150Lx) Daylight LED lighting, offering a comfortable, well-illuminated environment. </p><p></p>",
