    "d860300d-7c49-4055-87c4-01913a46c1c6": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16505126420705__d860300d-7c49-4055-87c4-01913a46c1c6-question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I access the booth?",
            "text": "<p>Externally to the left is a touch less sensor on the frame, wave your had in front to open the door. Allow easier access and hygiene smart!</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16505126420705__d860300d-7c49-4055-87c4-01913a46c1c6-question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the booth easy to access with a wheel chair",
            "text": "<p>Our agile acoustic DDA booths are floor level entry, allowing easy access for wheel chairs. Additionally the touch less entry button automatically opens the door for users.</p>"
          }
        },
        "62d5b51a-c8c9-429f-a5ee-39d7beb372e3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes our accessibility booth suitable",
            "text": "<p>Sustainability is a core aspect of the Folio Meeting Booth's design. It incorporates recycled materials, with each booth containing approximately ≥180kg of recycled materials per 12m²/0.66m³. The booth also boasts a remarkably low carbon footprint of ≤0.071kg CO2e and minimal energy consumption of ≤0.4MJ, aligning with our commitment to eco-conscious design.</p>"
          }
        },
        "179bc003-ecfe-4d1e-92ab-394998b9c663": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Power supply set up, do we need to do any thing?",
            "text": "<p>No. All our booths come with a 13amp power supply which plugs into the side of the booth with standard insert. Plug into your wall socket with locally supplied wall plug. If you are purchasing in UK, Europe or the US you will be supplied with local wall socket and correct electrical certificated components CE / UL Certificated.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
